## Project Outcome

After completing the exercises, I was able to:

* Install and verify Sysmon
* Access Sysmon events through Windows Event Viewer
* Analyze process creation events using Event ID 1
* Investigate network connections using Event ID 3
* Examine file creation activity using Event ID 11
* Review image/DLL loading using Event ID 7
* Identify unusual processes, connections, files, and image loads
* Use Sysmon data as a source for Windows security monitoring and incident investigation
